  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "あさひ、イベントの前半戦、お疲れ様！\r\nいい出来だったぞ",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "この調子で後半も──",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2017004040020,
    "speaker": "あさひ",
    "text": "──今日のステージは……何が……",
    "charAnim2": "face_close2",
    "charAnim3": "no",
    "charAnim3Loop": false,
    "charLipAnim": "lip_anger",
    "charLabel": "asahi",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/201700404/2017004040020"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "……何か気になっているみたいだな",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2017004040030,
    "speaker": "あさひ",
    "text": "考えても考えても答えが出ないんすよ",
    "charAnim1": "wait3",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_surp",
    "charLabel": "asahi",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/201700404/2017004040030"
  },
  {
    "id": 2017004040040,
    "speaker": "あさひ",
    "text": "いつも違うんす\r\nステージで感じる楽しさが",
    "charAnim1": "think1",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_surp",
    "charLabel": "asahi",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/201700404/2017004040040"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "楽しさの違い……か",
    "textCtrl": "l",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "select": "あさひにとって\r\n大事なことだな",
    "nextLabel": "1"
  },
  {
    "select": "まずは後半戦を\r\n楽しもう",
    "nextLabel": "2"
  },
  {
    "textCtrl": "cm",
    "select": "どういうふうに\r\n違うと感じるんだ",
    "nextLabel": "3"
  },
  {
    "id": 2017004040050,
    "label": "1",
    "speaker": "あさひ",
    "text": "大事なこと……",
    "charAnim1": "wait2",
    "charAnim2": "face_surp",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_surp",
    "charLabel": "asahi",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/201700404/2017004040050"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "ああ、あさひはいつも楽しいことを探しているだろ\r\nだからこそ、きっと今回もそれが気になるんだと思う",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2017004040060,
    "speaker": "あさひ",
    "text": "そうっす！　そうなんすよ！",
    "charAnim1": "anger1",
    "charAnim2": "face_smile2",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "asahi",
    "textCtrl": "r",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/201700404/2017004040060",
    "voiceKeep": true
  },
  {
    "speaker": "あさひ",
    "text": "なのに、なんで答えが出ないんすかね……",
    "charAnim2": "face_sad",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "asahi",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "これはあくまで俺の意見でしかないんだけどな",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "あさひの中には、生まれたばかりの\r\n色んな気持ちがあると思うんだ",
    "charAnim1": "wait3",
    "charAnim2": "face_surp",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_serious_s",
    "charLabel": "asahi",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "だから、まだその気持ちを言い表す言葉が\r\n見つからないんじゃないかな",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2017004040070,
    "speaker": "あさひ",
    "text": "生まれたばかりの気持ち……\r\nだから……言葉にできない……",
    "charAnim1": "sad1",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charAnim4": "eye_right",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_surp",
    "charLabel": "asahi",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/201700404/2017004040070"
  },
  {
    "id": 2017004040080,
    "speaker": "あさひ",
    "text": "じゃあ、まだ答えはわからない……？",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charAnim4": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_surp",
    "charLabel": "asahi",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/201700404/2017004040080"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "焦ることはないよ\r\nゆっくりと表現できるようになるのを待とう",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "あさひがアイドルを続けていれば、\r\nいつか自然に答えが出るよ",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "charAnim1": "wait3",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_serious_s",
    "charLabel": "asahi",
    "textFrame": "off",
    "waitType": "time",
    "waitTime": 1500
  },
  {
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait_s",
