    "waitTime": 1500
  },
  {
    "id": 2017004040090,
    "label": "2",
    "speaker": "あさひ",
    "text": "けど、それで答えがわかるんすか？",
    "charAnim1": "surp2",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_surp",
    "charLabel": "asahi",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/201700404/2017004040090"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "わかるかもしれ──",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2017004040100,
    "speaker": "あさひ",
    "text": "──やったっす！　早く後半、始まらないっすかねぇ",
    "charAnim1": "smile3",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "asahi",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/201700404/2017004040100"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "まぁまぁ、まだ話は終わってないから\r\nちょっと待ってくれって",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2017004040110,
    "speaker": "あさひ",
    "text": "？",
    "charAnim1": "wait3",
    "charAnim2": "face_surp",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_serious_s",
    "charLabel": "asahi",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/201700404/2017004040110"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "わかるかもしれないし、\r\nずっとわからないかもしれない",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "そう言いたかったんだよ",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2017004040120,
    "speaker": "あさひ",
    "text": "わからないかもしれないんすか……",
    "charAnim1": "sad1",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_surp",
    "charLabel": "asahi",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/201700404/2017004040120"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "ああ\r\n……けどな、それは全部あさひ次第だよ",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2017004040130,
    "speaker": "あさひ",
    "text": "わたし次第……",
    "charAnim1": "wait2",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_surp",
    "charLabel": "asahi",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/201700404/2017004040130"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "そうだ。ひとつひとつ\r\n目の前のことにあさひが全力で取り組むこと",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "それが、きっと一番の近道だよ",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2017004040140,
    "speaker": "あさひ",
    "text": "……",
    "charAnim2": "face_surp",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait_s",
    "charLabel": "asahi",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/201700404/2017004040140"
  },
  {
    "id": 2017004040150,
    "speaker": "あさひ",
    "text": "そっすね！\r\n今はとにかく全力で取り組んでくるっす！",
    "charAnim1": "smile1",
    "charAnim2": "face_anger2",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "asahi",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "nextLabel": "end",
    "voice": "produce_events/201700404/2017004040150"
  },
  {
    "textFrame": "off"
  },
  {
    "id": 2017004040160,
    "label": "3",
    "speaker": "あさひ",
    "text": "どういうふうに……っすか\r\nうーん……",
    "charAnim1": "sad2",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charAnim4": "eye_right",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_surp",
    "charLabel": "asahi",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/201700404/2017004040160"
  },
  {
    "id": 2017004040170,
    "speaker": "あさひ",
    "text": "……",
    "charAnim2": "face_close",
    "charAnim3": "no",
    "charAnim3Loop": false,
    "charAnim4": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_serious_s",
    "charLabel": "asahi",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/201700404/2017004040170"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "（聞き方が悪かったかな……\r\nちょっと質問を変えてみよう……）",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "それじゃあ、今までで一番印象に残っているのは\r\nどのステージだ？",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLabel": "asahi",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2017004040180,
    "speaker": "あさひ",
    "text": "この前のイベントっす！",
    "charAnim1": "anger2",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charAnim3": "yes",
    "charAnim3Loop": false,
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "asahi",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/201700404/2017004040180"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "それはなんでだと思う？",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2017004040190,
    "speaker": "あさひ",
    "text": "こうしたいっていうのがどんどん浮かんできて\r\n止まらなかったっす！",
    "charAnim1": "smile3",
    "charAnim2": "face_smile",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "asahi",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/201700404/2017004040190"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "ありがとう\r\nじゃあ、他にパッと思い浮かぶのはあるか？",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2017004040200,
    "speaker": "あさひ",
    "text": "……先月のミニライブっすかね……",
    "charAnim1": "wait3",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_surp",
    "charLabel": "asahi",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/201700404/2017004040200"
  },
  {
    "id": 2017004040210,
    "speaker": "あさひ",
    "text": "反応がよかったんすよ\r\nお客さん、近かったんで",
    "charAnim1": "smile1",
    "charAnim2": "face_smile2",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "asahi",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/201700404/2017004040210"
  },
  {
    "id": 2017004040220,
    "speaker": "あさひ",
    "text": "だから、やりたいことをやってみたんす",
    "charAnim1": "smile2",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "asahi",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/201700404/2017004040220"
  },
  {
    "id": 2017004040230,
    "speaker": "あさひ",
    "text": "そしたら、もっと盛り上がったっす！",
    "charAnim1": "surp1",
    "charAnim2": "face_smile",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "asahi",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/201700404/2017004040230"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "なるほどな……",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "あさひの楽しさは、もしかしたら『気付き』\r\nに根付いているのかもな",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLabel": "asahi",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "そこから『次はこうしたい！』っていう\r\n気持ちが生まれてくるからどんどん新しいことをしたくなる",
    "charAnim2": "face_surp",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_serious_s",
    "charLabel": "asahi",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "それが要因のひとつになってるんじゃないかな",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2017004040240,
    "speaker": "あさひ",
    "text": "気付き……",
    "charAnim1": "surp2",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_surp",
    "charLabel": "asahi",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/201700404/2017004040240"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "もちろん、それだけじゃないとは思うし\r\nあくまで推測だから",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "あさひにとって納得いく答えかはわからない\r\nだから、ここから先は自分と向き合ってみてほしい",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2017004040250,
    "speaker": "あさひ",
    "text": "……プロデューサーさん\r\nありがとっす！",
    "charAnim1": "anger2",
    "charAnim2": "face_smile2",
    "charAnim3": "yes",
    "charAnim3Loop": false,
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "asahi",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/201700404/2017004040250"
  },
  {
    "id": 2017004040260,
    "speaker": "あさひ",
    "text": "もしかしたら、これで何かわかるかもっす！\r\n今日のイベントの後、色々考えてみるっすよ！",
    "charAnim1": "anger1",
    "charAnim2": "face_anger2",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
